    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/18493f7c9985647c3c994a0c19b9e98a.avif?t=1753848506\" width=614 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>\u2635 HIRAETH</strong> - A gripping sci-fi survival experience where you awaken on the forsaken planet <strong>Ahra Prime</strong>. Navigate through its harsh, diverse landscapes filled with secrets and dangers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Modes:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ETERNAL Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/ed4d5daede6eb1a8d856618fc4d272c9.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an endless survival sandbox where your skills are your only ally. Survive, explore, and uncover lore that deepens with each playthrough.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REVELATIONS Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/c896e41fbc058378fe2db448ba7f3c99.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a narrative-driven journey, uncovering the mysteries of Ahra Prime guided by the enigmatic Charon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-Crafted Open World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/5ebe797fa4cfc5d80a140edb1625200d.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the planet for resources, facing environmental hazards and predators. Every journey is a test of survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Survival Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/0c0da008bd5f8fbef6425831f55ea7c4.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage hunger, hydration, health, and equipment durability in a system tailored for both novice and seasoned survivors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting &amp; Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/aa105d66b30ec6573af8a134c798109f.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master crafting to create essential gear and upgrade your EVA suit for better survival odds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progressive Skills &amp; Perks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/08603ef07561903aa9055d30ab457ae1.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn skills and perks that enhance your abilities, making each survival attempt more strategic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/e9c90bd3edc84784117f9da8f44dfcb2.avif?t=1753848506\" width=694 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/4b1fc56be5dc063d765891b65df90387.poster.avif?t=1753848506\" width=694 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/4b1fc56be5dc063d765891b65df90387.webm?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/4b1fc56be5dc063d765891b65df90387.mp4?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Companions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/e201ee835cb62e3a378864187f96c4c1.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between a quirky alien slug or a high-tech droid to assist in your adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/035660d3a47f2e7bef9cc5c4898ed2b3.avif?t=1753848506\" width=694 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/c542c80046020d84a3d124a397ebfca4.poster.avif?t=1753848506\" width=694 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/c542c80046020d84a3d124a397ebfca4.webm?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/c542c80046020d84a3d124a397ebfca4.mp4?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/3b0e3fbf80439a2350332ae396dac092.avif?t=1753848506\" width=694 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/e2ea691a0efa15ca8af4ddc7d2fa1f86.poster.avif?t=1753848506\" width=694 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/e2ea691a0efa15ca8af4ddc7d2fa1f86.webm?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/e2ea691a0efa15ca8af4ddc7d2fa1f86.mp4?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For New Players:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/55a314169ba699c09e0b72041b8769de.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training Course:</strong> A dedicated center to learn the ropes, ensuring everyone can grasp the game's unique mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Audio Experience:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/42febb15652822a03bebe307b1b81022.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Soundtrack: </strong>Immerse yourself in the desolation of Ahra Prime with an electronic score that complements the game's mood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why \u2635 HIRAETH?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a lone wolf tackling the planet's perils head-on or a strategist avoiding conflict, <strong>\u2635 HIRAETH</strong> offers freedom in survival. With every playthrough unique due to randomization and player choices, your saga on Ahra Prime will be as unpredictable as the planet itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/57579443d71fd8f159b3607b8b678391.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Remember, on Ahra Prime,\u00a0</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;wise men speak, and fools decide.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Which will you be?</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY SINGLE PLAYER?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advantages Of Single Player Games Over Multiplayer:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 Engaging Storyline:</strong>\u00a0Single player games often offer deeper and more complex narratives that can provide emotional experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 No Dependency on Others:\u00a0</strong>You don't have to wait for other players or worry about their skills or behavior. The game progresses at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 Full Control:\u00a0</strong>You have complete control over the gameplay, allowing you to explore the game's world and uncover its secrets at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 No Connection Issues:</strong>\u00a0No need for a stable internet connection, meaning you can play anytime, anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 Personalized Experience:</strong>\u00a0Single player games often offer greater opportunities for personalization and individual approaches to gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 Achievements and Challenges:</strong>\u00a0Focus on individual achievements and challenges, which can be satisfying to accomplish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 Peace and Quiet:</strong>\u00a0No risk of harassment or toxic behavior from other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 Slower Aging of the Game:\u00a0</strong>Single player games age more slowly, as players are willing to return to them even after many years. Multiplayer games typically have a shorter lifespan, dependent on community activity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY HIRAETH STANDS OUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many survival games follow a familiar formula: chop trees, build structures, craft, and survive. Hiraeth breaks this mold by offering a unique and immersive survival experience that keeps the fun and flow intact.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2705\u00a0Innovative Survival Mechanics:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat, Drink, Rest, Heal, Recharge, Manage Oxygen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always monitor your EVA Suit's air supply.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage and maintain gear and health.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2705\u00a0Four Difficulty Levels:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wayfarer:\u00a0</strong>Easy, focus on story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drifter:\u00a0</strong>Normal, balanced challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outcast:\u00a0</strong>Hard, for veterans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Void Rider:</strong>\u00a0Nightmare, extreme challenge.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2705\u00a0Player Freedom:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playstyles:</strong>\u00a0aggressive or strategic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomization</strong>, accessibility options, rougelite elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique gameplay each session</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2705\u00a0Accessibility and Elegance:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable\u00a0<strong>parental settings</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed<strong>\u00a0for diverse skill levels</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoids unnecessary gore</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/c0e1cdaf40401e2a9d0a45dad85de011.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/beb4448883e98d4ea49ac15882c679f6.poster.avif?t=1753848506\" width=768 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/beb4448883e98d4ea49ac15882c679f6.webm?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/beb4448883e98d4ea49ac15882c679f6.mp4?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/0f92756a25ae4cfa583f27f4b3919054.poster.avif?t=1753848506\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/0f92756a25ae4cfa583f27f4b3919054.webm?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/0f92756a25ae4cfa583f27f4b3919054.mp4?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/9885127b8e2568a56862aa1f600cf607.poster.avif?t=1753848506\" width=800 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/9885127b8e2568a56862aa1f600cf607.webm?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/9885127b8e2568a56862aa1f600cf607.mp4?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/c2592ac94f057c06c6be6c970ecd5783.poster.avif?t=1753848506\" width=800 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/c2592ac94f057c06c6be6c970ecd5783.webm?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/c2592ac94f057c06c6be6c970ecd5783.mp4?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/9f0c8f07fe7528889ed2c2eebd0c83c2.poster.avif?t=1753848506\" width=782 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/9f0c8f07fe7528889ed2c2eebd0c83c2.webm?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/9f0c8f07fe7528889ed2c2eebd0c83c2.mp4?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/f56bc4b90103f6dfc3556e9947f4339e.poster.avif?t=1753848506\" width=800 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/f56bc4b90103f6dfc3556e9947f4339e.webm?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/f56bc4b90103f6dfc3556e9947f4339e.mp4?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/18493f7c9985647c3c994a0c19b9e98a.avif?t=1753848506\" width=614 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>\u2635 HIRAETH</strong> - A gripping sci-fi survival experience where you awaken on the forsaken planet <strong>Ahra Prime</strong>. Navigate through its harsh, diverse landscapes filled with secrets and dangers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Modes:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ETERNAL Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/ed4d5daede6eb1a8d856618fc4d272c9.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into an endless survival sandbox where your skills are your only ally. Survive, explore, and uncover lore that deepens with each playthrough.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REVELATIONS Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/c896e41fbc058378fe2db448ba7f3c99.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a narrative-driven journey, uncovering the mysteries of Ahra Prime guided by the enigmatic Charon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand-Crafted Open World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/5ebe797fa4cfc5d80a140edb1625200d.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour the planet for resources, facing environmental hazards and predators. Every journey is a test of survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Survival Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/0c0da008bd5f8fbef6425831f55ea7c4.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage hunger, hydration, health, and equipment durability in a system tailored for both novice and seasoned survivors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting &amp; Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/aa105d66b30ec6573af8a134c798109f.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master crafting to create essential gear and upgrade your EVA suit for better survival odds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progressive Skills &amp; Perks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/08603ef07561903aa9055d30ab457ae1.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn skills and perks that enhance your abilities, making each survival attempt more strategic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/e9c90bd3edc84784117f9da8f44dfcb2.avif?t=1753848506\" width=694 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/4b1fc56be5dc063d765891b65df90387.poster.avif?t=1753848506\" width=694 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/4b1fc56be5dc063d765891b65df90387.webm?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/4b1fc56be5dc063d765891b65df90387.mp4?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Companions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/e201ee835cb62e3a378864187f96c4c1.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between a quirky alien slug or a high-tech droid to assist in your adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/035660d3a47f2e7bef9cc5c4898ed2b3.avif?t=1753848506\" width=694 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/c542c80046020d84a3d124a397ebfca4.poster.avif?t=1753848506\" width=694 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/c542c80046020d84a3d124a397ebfca4.webm?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/c542c80046020d84a3d124a397ebfca4.mp4?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/3b0e3fbf80439a2350332ae396dac092.avif?t=1753848506\" width=694 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/e2ea691a0efa15ca8af4ddc7d2fa1f86.poster.avif?t=1753848506\" width=694 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/e2ea691a0efa15ca8af4ddc7d2fa1f86.webm?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/e2ea691a0efa15ca8af4ddc7d2fa1f86.mp4?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For New Players:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/55a314169ba699c09e0b72041b8769de.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Training Course:</strong> A dedicated center to learn the ropes, ensuring everyone can grasp the game's unique mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Audio Experience:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/42febb15652822a03bebe307b1b81022.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Soundtrack: </strong>Immerse yourself in the desolation of Ahra Prime with an electronic score that complements the game's mood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why \u2635 HIRAETH?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a lone wolf tackling the planet's perils head-on or a strategist avoiding conflict, <strong>\u2635 HIRAETH</strong> offers freedom in survival. With every playthrough unique due to randomization and player choices, your saga on Ahra Prime will be as unpredictable as the planet itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/57579443d71fd8f159b3607b8b678391.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Remember, on Ahra Prime,\u00a0</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;wise men speak, and fools decide.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Which will you be?</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY SINGLE PLAYER?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advantages Of Single Player Games Over Multiplayer:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 Engaging Storyline:</strong>\u00a0Single player games often offer deeper and more complex narratives that can provide emotional experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 No Dependency on Others:\u00a0</strong>You don't have to wait for other players or worry about their skills or behavior. The game progresses at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 Full Control:\u00a0</strong>You have complete control over the gameplay, allowing you to explore the game's world and uncover its secrets at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 No Connection Issues:</strong>\u00a0No need for a stable internet connection, meaning you can play anytime, anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 Personalized Experience:</strong>\u00a0Single player games often offer greater opportunities for personalization and individual approaches to gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 Achievements and Challenges:</strong>\u00a0Focus on individual achievements and challenges, which can be satisfying to accomplish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 Peace and Quiet:</strong>\u00a0No risk of harassment or toxic behavior from other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2705 Slower Aging of the Game:\u00a0</strong>Single player games age more slowly, as players are willing to return to them even after many years. Multiplayer games typically have a shorter lifespan, dependent on community activity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY HIRAETH STANDS OUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many survival games follow a familiar formula: chop trees, build structures, craft, and survive. Hiraeth breaks this mold by offering a unique and immersive survival experience that keeps the fun and flow intact.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2705\u00a0Innovative Survival Mechanics:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat, Drink, Rest, Heal, Recharge, Manage Oxygen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always monitor your EVA Suit's air supply.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage and maintain gear and health.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2705\u00a0Four Difficulty Levels:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wayfarer:\u00a0</strong>Easy, focus on story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drifter:\u00a0</strong>Normal, balanced challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outcast:\u00a0</strong>Hard, for veterans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Void Rider:</strong>\u00a0Nightmare, extreme challenge.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2705\u00a0Player Freedom:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playstyles:</strong>\u00a0aggressive or strategic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomization</strong>, accessibility options, rougelite elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique gameplay each session</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2705\u00a0Accessibility and Elegance:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable\u00a0<strong>parental settings</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed<strong>\u00a0for diverse skill levels</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Avoids unnecessary gore</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/c0e1cdaf40401e2a9d0a45dad85de011.avif?t=1753848506\" width=616 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/beb4448883e98d4ea49ac15882c679f6.poster.avif?t=1753848506\" width=768 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/beb4448883e98d4ea49ac15882c679f6.webm?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/beb4448883e98d4ea49ac15882c679f6.mp4?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/0f92756a25ae4cfa583f27f4b3919054.poster.avif?t=1753848506\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/0f92756a25ae4cfa583f27f4b3919054.webm?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/0f92756a25ae4cfa583f27f4b3919054.mp4?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/9885127b8e2568a56862aa1f600cf607.poster.avif?t=1753848506\" width=800 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/9885127b8e2568a56862aa1f600cf607.webm?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/9885127b8e2568a56862aa1f600cf607.mp4?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/c2592ac94f057c06c6be6c970ecd5783.poster.avif?t=1753848506\" width=800 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/c2592ac94f057c06c6be6c970ecd5783.webm?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/c2592ac94f057c06c6be6c970ecd5783.mp4?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/9f0c8f07fe7528889ed2c2eebd0c83c2.poster.avif?t=1753848506\" width=782 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/9f0c8f07fe7528889ed2c2eebd0c83c2.webm?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/9f0c8f07fe7528889ed2c2eebd0c83c2.mp4?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/f56bc4b90103f6dfc3556e9947f4339e.poster.avif?t=1753848506\" width=800 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/f56bc4b90103f6dfc3556e9947f4339e.webm?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2646160/extras/f56bc4b90103f6dfc3556e9947f4339e.mp4?t=1753848506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
